# Her Memories: Of Malign Maladies (crystalWar 72), the rivals at Amaura and Raustigne. A level 99 Warrior in Southern
# San d'Oria with the WotG mission Her Memories current (a GM; other logs as group 1's flows) and Homecoming Queen
# accepted (a GM) with Thierride's Bean Creation. Amaura answers Malign's 955 (available) and Homecoming Queen's 958
# (the bean), both Progress: the tie goes to the first container, Homecoming Queen: 958, finished: the bean taken, Prog1
# 1. Then 955 (Progress) over 959 (an Event), finished: Malign begun. Then 959 and 956 (Events, oncePerZone) tie: 959
# (the cycle is at 958, not in the tie), finished; her script answers nothing on the turn after an Event, so the lookup
# plays 956; both shown: her default 642. Southern San d'Oria [S]: Boy and the Beast (group 2: Claws and Perils of the
# Griffon and the mission Back to the Beginning completed (GMs), then Her Memories current) answers Raustigne with 55
# (Progress) at its Prog 0, and Malign (Prog 3 and the Fey Stone: GMs) with 169 (Progress): the tie goes to the first
# container, Malign: 169, finished: completed (Large Memory Fragment 2), the Fey Stone taken. Then 55 alone.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Amaura/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/955 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/958 SouthernSanDoriaS/Raustigne/onTrigger SouthernSanDoriaS/onEventFinish/55 SouthernSanDoriaS/onEventFinish/169
